---
description: Authfly widgets on UI8Kit 3 (packages/ui/*)
globs: packages/ui/**
alwaysApply: false
---
- Primitives in `ui/`, `src/ui/`, utils/runtime folders, `ui8kit.config.json`, `ui8kit.lock.json` are CLI-owned
  (`npx ui8kit@3`, registry 3.3.0): never edit by hand; run `npx ui8kit@3 check` before committing.
- Build widgets from primitives + the Authfly skin (tokens only) + the middle layer (Card, Stack, Group, Form,
  Title, Alert, Badge, IconBadge, Field, LucideIcon). No asChild outside React.
- Pass text via props; children HTML is trusted. Field: aria-describedby = hint + field error + form error id,
  aria-invalid when an error is shown.
- Keep props identical across runtimes and DOM parity with React for `packages/ui/react/tests/states.json`.
- Don't touch `.ui8px/` policy; lint rendered HTML with ui8px.
- HTML/ARIA gates: `bun run gates` (`tools/gates.sh`, vendored `tools/ui-gates` from codegen-x/ui8kit@9b70551e, see its VENDORED.md): source gate (no raw HTML where a primitive exists, Box/Text tag allowlist) + html-validate/axe-core over the 20 states × 9 runtimes. Must report 0 problems before a commit. Live-region roles (`status`/`alert`) go on the widget head Stack, never on the heading.
